# Example environment file for OPTIONAL regeneration of the cached model
# annotations. The default reproduction (make results / make supplement) is
# API-FREE and needs NONE of these — it reads the committed files under
# data/api_cached/.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in only if you intend to re-run the provenance
# pipelines under code/provenance/ (this costs money). `.env` is gitignored;
# never commit a real key.
#
# All shipped pipelines route through OpenRouter (claim extraction/coding and
# eligibility = openai/gpt-5-mini; fact-checking = perplexity/sonar-pro; topic
# embeddings/labels = google gemini models via OpenRouter; stance raters and
# explanation coding likewise). See prompts/.env.example for the per-pipeline
# model/tuning knobs.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
